    "name": "Cluck To The Top!",
    "steam_appid": 2520840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/a169937897e875773c57db03e9765946.poster.avif?t=1752694683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/a169937897e875773c57db03e9765946.webm?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/a169937897e875773c57db03e9765946.mp4?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jump. Fall. Rage. Repeat!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a chaotic, vertical rage platformer where gravity is your arch-nemesis and every jump could send you all the way back to the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Beef</strong>, a feathered hero on a mission to rescue his beloved <strong>Lil Spice</strong> from his evil brother <strong>Biff</strong>\u00a0by climbing a punishing, vertical world all the way to <strong>Biff\u2019s castle in the sky</strong>.<br><br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Core Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f <strong>Brutal vertical platforming</strong> with no checkpoints and a <strong>LOT</strong> of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80\u00a0<strong>No Save Points</strong>\u00a0saving is for the weak and <strong>YOU</strong> are not weak</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Hidden paths</strong>, secrets, and alternate routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Explosive hazards</strong>, traps, cannons, and collapsing platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc14 Play as <strong>Beef</strong>\u00a0- a determined rooster fueled by passion to save his girl</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd7\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Many bizarre zones</strong>\u00a0each packed with frustrating surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Egg Portals</strong> collect eggs to unlock portals that help you recover from falls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Enemies Everywhere</strong> over 20 different kinds of enemies want to knock you down</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d A World Torn Apart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/bdd14dcf448f8010712ca6cc0380695e.poster.avif?t=1752694683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/bdd14dcf448f8010712ca6cc0380695e.webm?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/bdd14dcf448f8010712ca6cc0380695e.mp4?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has shattered into floating islands and sky-high death traps. You\u2019ll bounce across collapsing cliffs, dodge cannonballs, outrun avalanches, and scramble up all in a desperate bid to reach the top.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Precision. Pain. Progress.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/72a02e259fbef4abd6b64a3ae8d20af0.poster.avif?t=1752694683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/72a02e259fbef4abd6b64a3ae8d20af0.webm?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/72a02e259fbef4abd6b64a3ae8d20af0.mp4?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump counts. Every mistake stings. One mistake, and you\u2019re plummeting all the way back down.\u00a0This isn't just a platformer.. this is <strong>punishment</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Hidden Paths &amp; Brutal Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/5ed669d901b72fc94e7b2373ed3dbbd0.poster.avif?t=1752694683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/5ed669d901b72fc94e7b2373ed3dbbd0.webm?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/5ed669d901b72fc94e7b2373ed3dbbd0.mp4?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore alternate paths, secret collectibles, and cursed corners that test your skill and your sanity. Want to impress the speed-running gods? The weirdest routes are often the fastest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 Brutally Difficult by Design<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/4cfd444677716e16af471ed21747b2de.poster.avif?t=1752694683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/4cfd444677716e16af471ed21747b2de.webm?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/4cfd444677716e16af471ed21747b2de.mp4?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made to hurt you. If you're into self-inflicted suffering - welcome home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc13 A Rooster\u2019s Redemption</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/2f3e3542d157937824f4fa91446ea346.poster.avif?t=1752694683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/2f3e3542d157937824f4fa91446ea346.webm?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/2f3e3542d157937824f4fa91446ea346.mp4?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beef isn\u2019t just climbing for glory - he\u2019s climbing for <strong>love</strong>.\u00a0\u00a0This is a story of betrayal, heartbreak, and proving that even the stubbiest wings can rise above it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh and don't stand in fire...</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/70a20eecc531e2bff0647d6840b3c6a2.poster.avif?t=1752694683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/70a20eecc531e2bff0647d6840b3c6a2.webm?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520840/extras/70a20eecc531e2bff0647d6840b3c6a2.mp4?t=1752694683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
